        <item>
            <title>1.4.4</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:04:29 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>71</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What’s fixed

- Ordered lists now keep the same font, wrapping, and line spacing across every item on older macOS versions.
- CueNow no longer lets the system’s automatic text replacement compete with its numbered-list editor, preventing malformed `1.Text` formatting.
- Glass notes on macOS 15 and earlier now use a translucent, appearance-adaptive background in both Light and Dark Mode.
- Shared diagnostic logs now include the macOS version, appearance, transparency setting, and note style to make display-specific reports actionable.
]]></description>
